    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "The main text decoder uses published E4M3 matrices with FP32 inverse scales per 128 × 128 block. The absorbed MLA key and value projections share the packed checkpoint layout. The analytical traffic assumes one read of the packed weights and scales, attributed by projection row width. Expert reads include scales for the locally touched matrices. Matrix execution and KV use the BF16 analytical baseline."
    }
